/// <summary>
/// C <c>&lt;time.h&gt;</c> calendar family: the <c>struct tm</c> broken-down
/// time type plus <c>gmtime</c> / <c>localtime</c> / <c>mktime</c> /
/// <c>asctime</c> / <c>ctime</c> / <c>strftime</c>. The scalar surface
